			<item>
				<title>철학 영화를 캐스팅하다</title>
				<link>https://ezaurum.com/2011/02/%EC%B2%A0%ED%95%99-%EC%98%81%ED%99%94%EB%A5%BC-%EC%BA%90%EC%8A%A4%ED%8C%85%ED%95%98%EB%8B%A4/</link>
